    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA Seamus Carthy is delighted to present this most impressive, A rated 4-bedroom detached family home to the marketplace. Nestled in a highly accessible village location in Tulsk, this property perfectly balances rural charm with modern convenience, sitting just 16 km from Roscommon Town with direct access onto the old N5. Beautifully framed by attractive, manicured gardens to both the front and rear, this home arrives on the market in excellent condition throughout, offering a true turn-key opportunity for discerning buyers seeking the ultimate family lifestyle. Internally, we have a bright and expansive layout designed for effortless modern living and entertaining. The ground floor boasts two generous reception rooms filled with natural light, flowing into an open-plan kitchen and dining area that serves as the heart of the home. A spacious utility room and a practical downstairs W.C. add to the seamless functionality of the property. Upstairs, the home features four well appointed bedrooms, including master en-suite, alongside a contemporary family bathroom. The property??s exceptional versatility extends outdoors, making it a standout choice for modern professionals and growing families alike. An adjoining garage has been expertly transformed into a home gym, but thanks to its independent separate access, it offers endless potential to be utilised as a high-end home office or private studio. Adding to its many features, a brand-new metal deck outdoor room offering leisure and entertainment space perfectly suited for hosting gatherings. Considered a select Family Home, equipped with Solar and Smart Battery System offering proven utility savings, vacant possession is readily available with immediate enquiries strongly advised. \n\nOutside\nPrivate Corner Site offering off street parking with garden areas to front, side and rear. 2 no. Timber Garden sheds handy for storage together with impressive outdoor metal deck entertainment room."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Energy Rating is A\nPrime Village Location\nDetached and presented in excellent condition\n4 Bedrooms with Master Ensuite\n2 no. reception rooms\nAdjoining Ground floor Room offering versatility \nPurpose Built outdoor Entertainment room\nEquipped with Solar and Smart Battery System offering proven utility savings\n\nAccommodation comprises of 2 no. reception rooms, Open plan Kitchen/Dining Room, spacious Utility, Downstairs W.C, Four Bedrooms ( 1 ensuite), Family Bathroom. Externally, Adjoining Garage currently laid out as a Home Gym is suitable to a variety of uses given its separate access - Home Office etc. Externally, we have a large metal deck outdoor room currently utilised as leisure/entertainment room. \n All Main Services, Water, ESB, Sewer. \n Tulsk Village is located on the old N5 national primary road between Strokestown and Bellanagare. It is 16 km north of Roscommon town. Village amenities include local Shops, Petrol Station, Church, Primary School, GAA Pitch ."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
